    "summary_insights": [
      "Revenue grew by 14.6% year-on-year, reaching £2.39m, indicating strong top-line momentum.",
      "Gross margin compressed from 46.9% to 43.7%, driven by a significant 21.4% increase in cost of sales, particularly subcontractor costs.",
      "Operating profit declined by 2.5% despite the revenue growth, as administrative expenses rose by 16.5%.",
      "Net profit fell by 3.5% to £333k, with net margin dropping from 16.6% to 14.0% due to rising overheads.",
      "Staff costs (excluding directors) increased by 26.4%, reflecting the rise in average employee headcount from 8 to 10.",
      "Interest coverage remains exceptionally high at 92.1x, though it has decreased from the previous year's 152.8x.",
      "The company maintains a healthy balance sheet with net assets increasing from £478k to £717k.",
      "Directors' loan accounts show significant debit balances totalling £159,863 at year-end, which may require further investigation."
    ]
